        "dotnet build backend/Hrms.sln"
      ],
      "notes": "2026-03-30: Local Windows verification confirms .NET 8 SDK is installed and `dotnet restore backend/Hrms.sln` succeeds. Initial `dotnet build backend/Hrms.sln` failures were `CS0234` in `IApplicationDbContext` (unnecessary EF Core using) and `CS0246` test symbol resolution for `[Fact]`. 2026-03-30: Applied fixes by removing the EF Core using in Application abstraction and adding explicit `using Xunit;` in test files. Re-run local verification to confirm T001 completion; do not mark completed until build passes."
